error BYN1047: `/* */` is an input form; write `//` lines

  11 │ union Size { /* small */ s, m /* medium */, l }
     │              ^^^^^^^^^^^ block comment
     │
  help: write each line with `//`
     │ 11 │ union Size { // small
     │    │               +++++++
     │ 12 │  s, m /* medium */, l }

